# =================================================
# Define survey name and "permanent" SNANA ID.
# Here are some recommended ID-conventions, although 
# they are not required:
#
#   ground-based z > .05:  1-49   
#   nearby Hubble flow:   50-99
#   space-based:         >= 100
#
# Do not forget to also assign a FIELD below.
#
# Apr 13, 2020 DJones - add CfAIR2 (69) 
# Apr 13, 2020 RK - remove obsolete CSP3(68) and XIAN(14)
# Dec 01, 2020 RK cleanup, comment out SNAP, EUCLID, GAIA, HDF
# Dec 04, 2020 RK.MD  add CALAN_TOLOLO, OTHER, JLA_LOWZ_COMBINED
# Dec 09, 2020 RK remove tabs
# Jan 30, 2021 RK add NGRST (and keep WFIRST for back-compatibility)
# May  6, 2021 Paleo add YSE_ZTF (combined YSE, ZTF) (19)
# Aug  6, 2021 RK - add SIRAH
# Oct 21, 2021 RK - add K21_LOWZ_COMBINED and PPLUS_LOWZ_COMBINED
# Jan 18, 2022 RK - add DES5YR_LOWZ_COMBINED
# Apr 29, 2022 JP - add UKIRT and RAISIN for SALT3-NIR work
# Sep 29, 2022 RK, D.Brout 
#               - add CNIa (aka ASASSN) and SOUSA (aka SWIFT)
#               - remove KAITM and KAITW ... just use KAIT
#
# Jun 2023 RK - Add geo:[lat],[lon],[alt] information for DES and LSST ...
#                needed for atmosphere effects
#
# Jul 29 2023 RK - replace NGRST (102) with ROMAN; keep WFIRST for back-compat.
#
# Oct 18 2023 P. Armstrong - Add DEBASS SURVEY
# Mar  1, 2024 B Rose - add more Roman Field names
# Apr  2, 2024 M. Vincenzi - restore Euclid from obsolete 
# Apr  4. 2024 RK - remove obsolete TELESCOPE keys
#
# ==============================================================

                 SNANA
        name      ID
-------------------------------
SURVEY:  SDSS      1
SURVEY:  ESSENCE   3
SURVEY:  SNLS      4  # SN Legacy Survey at CFHT
SURVEY:  CSP       5  # Carnegie SN Program with NIR
SURVEY:  SUBARU    6  # Hyper Supreme Cam

SURVEY:  DEBASS    9  # Oct 18 2023 P. Armstrong - Dark Energy Bedrock All Sky Survey (DECam)
SURVEY:  DES       10  geo:-30.24,-70.75,2200          # Dark Energy Survey
SURVEY:  VIDEO     11                                  # VIsta Deep Extragal Obs (YJHK)
SURVEY:  LSST      12  geo:-30.244639,-70.749417,2647  # Large Synoptic Sky Survey
SURVEY:  PS1MD     15  # Pan-STARRS 1 Medium Deep Survey
SURVEY:  JPAS      16  # Javalambre Physics of Acceleration Survey
SURVEY:  ZTF_MSIP  17  # ZTF mid-scale innovations program
SURVEY:  ASASSN    18  # ASASSN Followup
SURVEY:  CNIa      20  # renamed ASASSN to CNIa; D. Brout Sep 2022
SURVEY:  YSE_ZTF   19  # Combined YSE and ZTF surveys

SURVEY:  ATLAS     21  # ATLAS

SURVEY:  JRK07     49   # JRK 2007
SURVEY:  LOWZ      50   # generic LOWZ, or JRK 2007
SURVEY:  KAIT      51
